+// validator keeps refusing TV facts by construction (no era policy is threaded through them), and
+// `tvSave.ts` proves the root, its cross-owner capacity claims and the per-agreement
+// reconciliation of every TV row. The downgrade is lossless exactly while the root is empty and
+// no TV row exists; a recorded row refuses by name (`tvDowngradeRefusal`), the rule frozen
+// builders share. Every `=== P18_SAVE_VERSION` guard above is ONE hop through `convertV51ToV45`, so
