+// ── P18 — the television root at the save boundary (contract §8 "Old saves migrate with an empty TV root") ──
+//
+// The Save step hands the frozen predecessor chain a PROJECTION — the state without `television`,
+// without the five TV ledger rows and with cash reduced by their net — so the predecessor proves
+// the pre-TV state unchanged while this module proves the root itself, its cross-owner capacity
+// claims and the reconciliation of every TV ledger row with the one receipt that records the same
+// payment. Fail closed: a forged row is refused by name, never repaired.
+//
+// The receipts are the season's event log. `replayTelevision` walks each season's receipts under
+// the contract's law (the work order, one unit per boundary, the milestone and payment formulae,
+// the late deduction, refund-first settlement, the 52-week window) and the season and agreement
+// must equal what the log implies. Terms are recomputed from the ruleset and the commit week.
+
+import { assertNoDoubleBookedResourceSlots } from './occupancy.js'
+import { TUNING } from './tuning.js'
